graph TD
    subgraph Core Engine (.NET 10)
        HB[History Buffer - Ohlcv Data]
        VC[Virtual Canvas]
        VP[Viewport Manager]
    end

    subgraph Hardware Driver (MAUI Interop)
        TD[ITactileDriver]
        DTD[DotpadTactileDriver]
        SDK[DotPadSDK 3.0.0 native DLL]
        PD[Dot Pad 2nd-gen - 300 graphic cells + 20 braille cells]
    end

    HB -->|Render Full History| VC
    VC -->|Paging Logic| VP
    VP -->|Slice Device-Sized Window| TD
    TD -->|Push Packed Dot Buffer| DTD
    DTD -->|P/Invoke| SDK
    SDK -->|USB-Serial or BLE| PD

    PD -->|Pan / Function Keys| SDK
    SDK -->|Key Callback| DTD
    DTD -->|Navigate Event| VP
    VP -->|Update Window Offset| VC
